## Ignore Visual Studio temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular Visual Studio add-ons.
##
## This .gitignore file is based on the Visual Studio .gitignore from GitHub:
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/master/VisualStudio.gitignore

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr][Ee][Ll][Ee][Aa][Ss][Ee]/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][In][32]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
Build/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Studio 2015/2017 cache/options directory
.vs/

# User-specific files
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Visual Studio 2017+ Auto-generated files
Generated\ Files/

# Others
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*.log

# App Specific persistence
bin/
obj/
data/*.json
!data/config.json

publish/
/Build
